CONDEMNED-MOCKERY.description:
Gain {Block:diff()} [gold]block[/gold]. {InCombat:
Apply {Mockery:diff()} [gold]Jinx[/gold].|}
Applies {IfUpgraded:show:2|1} extra [gold]Jinx[/gold] for each [red]curse[/red] in your deck.

CONDEMNED-TITHE.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to ALL enemies. {InCombat:
Draw {Tithe:diff()} cards.|}
Draw one card for each enemy with [gold]Jinx[/gold].

CONDEMNED-PURGE.description:
Exhaust ALL your [red]curses[/red]. {InCombat:
Gain [blue]{Purge:diff()}[/blue] [gold]Strength[/gold]. }
Gain {PurgeBase:diff()} [gold]Strength[/gold] for each [red]curse[/red] [gold]Exhausted[/gold].
